{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の思い出話をありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔のこと、最近のこと、どちらにしても楽しそうで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな楽しい思い出がコメントに書き込んで下さった方以外にも、世界中のそれぞれの人の記憶にあって、いっぱい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもどれとして同じものは無く、そのデータはどこに蓄積されるんですかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"夏\" だけで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったら\" 春\"の思い出も\"冬\"の思い出も、誕生日も入学式も旅行も......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいごまで誰にも話されることもない話もあるし、人から人へいつまでも伝わる話もありますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダラダラとすみません、m(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/07/15/9714083/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田行きたかった〜W(`0`)WYES！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の夏にやっと初めて行って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田特有の美味しいものいっぱい食べれて、ホテルの部屋からめっちゃ綺麗な朝日を見れて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしさを知ったのでまた行きたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんの生まれた地、秋田！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、銀牙に反応してくださった方がいていと嬉しい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白い戦士ヤマト、銀牙〜流星〜銀、銀牙伝説WEEDは小、中学生の時に全巻揃えました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリオンはノータッチです...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/07/15/9714083/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●祭りで屋台出すなら何の屋台を出したい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷やしパインW(`0`)W"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●「夏が来たー！」と感じる瞬間を教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雲の形とか空気の匂い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝、暑さで起きる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●夏になって、七瀬さんはどんな幽霊と仲良くなりたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狐！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●ななせの髪の毛の長さって夏暑くないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もう何年もこの長さと付き合ってるので、慣れたもんですよえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●もし体にひとつだけスイッチをつけるとしたらどこにつける？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大動脈弓！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問も夏っぽいのが多くなってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/07/15/9714083/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まるってぃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"}